id: pm-memory-native-input-revision
title: Prepare memory verification resets for bulk and full-document updates
description: Support native input forms that require per-item guidance revision preparation before the locked SDK update.
type: Task
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-11-19T19:53:23.139Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-19T19:53:24.083Z"
