parent: pm-memory-recall-freshness
files[2]{path,scope}:
  src/content.ts,project
  src/native-host.ts,project
body: A real update-many body edit was refused by the active memory mutation guard and kept the original guidance. A real update using stdin JSON with a revised body and prior memory_verified_at and memory_reason was refused by the SDK unset conflict check. Support both forms with one audited mutation per edited memory. Preserve ordinary item behavior in mixed batches and clear server-owned verification evidence when a full document changes guidance.
